  "source": {
    "approvedEnglish": "A Cat’s Day\n\nI am a cat. My name is Mimi. I want to sleep. I want to eat. I see a soft bed. The bed is warm. I go to the bed. I lie down. I close my eyes. But I am hungry. I cannot sleep. I get up.\n\nI see a bowl. The bowl has no food. The bowl is empty. I am sad. I walk to the kitchen. I see a person. The person is a girl. The girl has fish. The fish is in her hand. I look at the girl. I say, “Meow.” The girl smiles. The girl gives the fish to me. I eat the fish. The fish is good.\n\nNow I am not hungry. I am happy. I walk back to the bed. The bed is still warm. I lie down. I close my eyes. I sleep.",
